{"id": 1365, "stem": "<div class=\"relative w-full min-w-0 max-w-full self-stretch\" id=\"question-text\"><span><p class=\"mb-4 text-start\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem;\"><mark class=\"bg-transparent dark:text-neutral-100\" data-markjs=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">A</mark> medical student is conducting a pharmacology experiment to determine the effects of a certain drug.\u00a0 She infuses this drug intravenously over different dose ranges and measures several important hemodynamic parameters.\u00a0 Graphs plotting the observed changes in renal blood flow and cardiac output are shown below.</p><div class=\"mb-4 text-start flex justify-start items-start\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem;\"><div class=\"group/triggerable\" data-is-open=\"false\"><div class=\"group/draggable\" data-is-draggable=\"true\" data-is-dragging=\"false\"><div class=\"group/resizable relative\" data-is-maximized=\"false\" data-is-resizable=\"true\" data-is-resizing=\"false\"><div class=\"w-full\"><button class=\"lg:max-w-lg md:max-w-md w-fit max-w-full my-5 hover:scale-[1.01] transition-[transform,_box-shadow] ease-in-out duration-500 hover:shadow-lg\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-none\" src=\"../../Assets/images/ago69dnw8z32bjslwimldx1f.jpg\"/></button></div></div></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-4 text-start\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem;\">Which of the following drugs was most likely used in this experiment?\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\